1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520
A crossword of numbers...

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:05,400
but every clue is a sum, not a word!

3
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:08,120
This is Kakuro!

4
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:12,700
Fill the blanks so each run adds up to its clue!

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:15,380
Down says nine...

6
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:18,200
three plus six makes nine!

7
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,280
Across says twelve...

8
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:26,040
three plus nine makes twelve — both runs solved!

9
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:33,420
No repeats in a run — every number from one to nine, used just once!

10
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:41,040
Parents — this builds sum decomposition, seeing numbers as parts of a whole!

11
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:48,200
Tap Math Game Zone, take on Kakuro, pick your level, and start summing!

12
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:54,700
Abacus Kids — always free to try, on the App Store and Google Play!
